-1 'THE TUNNELS' 'DWARF HQ' DWARFHQ TUNNELS~
THE TUNNELS
The Tunnels are the deep rock caves and caverns inhabited by the dwarves
of the main vein of dwarven lineage. As a result, it has been named the
Dwarven Headquarters by commoners of the Realm. 

It is said that the tunnels provide dwarves with a secret network of
tunnels to select locations, use mining, trade, and sometimes stealthy
attack. It is also rumored that the tunnels contain a secret prison of
racial enemies, mainly orcs.

created by Emperor, 1997

current version, 1.3



{-} EMPEROR
~
0 $~

#RANGES 0 99 0 99

#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG

#MOBILES
#1901
dwarf dwarven guardian~
The dwarven guardian~
A short, bearded man stands here, blocking the path.
~
You see before you a racial zealot with a cursed glance.
~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_UNDEAD
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_PROTECT_EVIL|AFF_TONGUES 0 S
99 BODY_HEAD BODY_LEG 1d10+19500 1d90+100
292510 RACE_DWARF
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 4
   if armystatus($n) == 0  
      say Greetings $n, the army awaits you.
      say Do you wish to enter?
   else
      if armystatus($n) == 1
         say Greetings Lord $n, your fellow warriors await you.
         say Do you wish to enter?
      else
         if armystatus($n) == 2
            say Greetings $n, hope the retired life treats you well.
            say Do you wish to enter?
         else
            say Greetings $n, the army awaits you.
            say Do you wish to enter?
         endif
      endif
   endif
else
   say Sorry $n, dwarves only
   mpecho The dwarven guardian utters the words, 'frawd'.
   mpechoat $n You disappear suddenly!
   mptransfer $n 9755
   mpecho $n disappears suddenly!
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
if race($n) == 4
   nod
   mpecho The dwarven guardian unlocks the tunnel door. 
   mpechoaround $n slides down into the caves!
   mpechoat $n You slide down the smooth tunnel!
   mptransfer $n 1903
   mpecho The dwarven guardian locks the tunnel door.
else
endif
~
|
