#1901      
Before The Cave~
A formless hole appears from nowhere, pulling you forward yet pushing you
away. Though you stand outside, you can see nonetheless that it is an
ancient geologic miracle: the combination of the finest quartz and the
strongest granite.
     There is a sign here.
     There is a cracked boulder here.
~
19 ROOM_DARK|ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_EAST
~
~
