#1902
The Entrance To The Cave~
You stand before the center of the Earth, the mouth of a gaping tunnel which
stretches deep, down into abyssal depths. Traversing the gorge would be a
fateful task for the unskilled: the thought of being crushed by pressurized
winds, impaled by outcroppings of rock, and incinerated by underground
rivers of molten lava rules out the possibility.
     A heavy tunnel door rests on the ground here.
~
19 ROOM_DARK|ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_EAST
~
~
0 -1 1901
E
door~
The door prevents you from entering the tunnel. It is said that the cavern
extends clear down to the center of the Earth! You step back out of fear.
~
S
#1903
The Beginning of the Tunnel~
You stand atop a solid granite path which extends far out into a vast
network of underground tunnels and passageways. A string of bright torches
guides you downward into a large cavern.
~
