#1904
Deep Below the Surface~
The carved path in which you walk is spacious and well-ventilated, obviously
a tunnel built by dwarven skill. There are etched drawings on the walls,
impressive and light with modest culture, and intricate symbols extolling
the dwarven kingdom. The beauty of dwarven civilization is truly
under-appreciated.
~
19 ROOM_DARK|ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
~
~
