#1906
The Dwarven Vein~
Incredibly, the granite rock beneath your feet is made of solid gold!
Stretching onward into a vast network of busy chambers, the tunnel widens
considerably. Open and powerful, the golden road immediately lends to your
thoughts of the vainglorious nobility whose egos flood the annals of ancient
dwarven history, and whose victories strike fear into young children
everywhere.  
~
