The Hall of Warriors~
You enter a room thick with wisdom and dense with honor. Maps, scrolls,
writings, and war devices of all kinds flood the corners of the room. The
room looks old and venerable as you peruse the ancient glyphs which cover
the furniture and walls. 
~
