#1934
The Eastern Shores~
The path turns to sand, the bulky rock turns to smooth limestone, and you
find yourself standing on the embankment of an enormous yet calm underground
river. Old boats lie strewn about, covered in ancient dwarven markings, and
your every sound echoes with the rhythmic cadence of crashing, salt-water waves.
~
